<Positioned left="84" top="1046"><Text fontSize="15" color="#33404EFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">The filled bar is a real 80 g bowl. The white notch is what the label's 45 g serving would use. Nobody eats 45 g of granola.</Text></Positioned>
