<Positioned left="60" top="1470"><Text fontSize="13" color="#5B6B7FFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">Nutrition figures are computed from a typical granola composition; the daily budgets are the standard reference values. Not dietary advice.</Text></Positioned>
